WEBVTT

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.730
It's great to see that you're so spirited.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.820
It's been a while since we've visited your grandfather, too.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.950
Keita-san, it would be great if we figured out what happened to your mother.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:15.360
Another helping, please.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.620
This is already your fourth bowl.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.870
I have to eat lots or I won't be able to defeat my brother!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.620
Do I have to fight, too?

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:29.750
A contracted Sub will be destroyed if he continues to fight, won't he?

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.010
Keita-san...

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.640
Oh, it's Excel-chan.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.350
When did you exchange phone numbers with her?

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.020
It's okay to tell her that we're going to Okinawa, right?

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.940
It seems they're heading to Okinawa tomorrow.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.230
Should I send Tribal Ends after them?

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.650
Hiyou-sama?

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:57.570
What the hell is this?!

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.750
Shit!

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:09.920
Who did this?!

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:14.420
Who the hell messed up my precious playground?!

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:18.010
Toshirou!

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.680
Find the bastards who messed up my playground!

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.350
Okay.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:26.020
Also, Reishin-sama is looking for you.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:28.020
I want Kuro.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.440
Kuro-sama... She's the only one whom I refuse to yield to others!

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.240
Are you okay?

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:43.950
Rather than worry about me, get rid of them!

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.420
I want to avoid unnecessary fights.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.050
It's okay if we manage to escape.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:55.010
Impossible!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:00.970
"Kuro's Past"

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.260
I brought our swimsuits along.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:03.680
Swimsuits? Are those different from underwear?

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.310
You wear them when you go swimming.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.770
You have too much chest fat.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:13.320
It's good to go for a swim to reduce it a little.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.650
I-Is that so?

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:27.830
Aren't they Tribal Ends?

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:28.750
Yes.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.330
Kuro, wait up!

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.540
Gotcha!

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.590
You were a pain to deal with.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.430
Riona-san.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:46.470
I told you that we're not gonna escape!

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.480
Hey, hey, you're arguing with each other?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.980
Um... Can you let us go?

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:53.480
Impossible!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.610
Just give up.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.900
Kuro-chan, shouldn't we help them?

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.150
They'll be okay.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.950
Looks like we don't have a choice.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:04.240
What?!

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.330
Here I go.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.430
You're just a stray Mototsumitama!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.900
Gosh!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.700
You should've fought right from the start!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.780
Look, I scraped my knee.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:49.330
Well, it's okay since it's just a slight—

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.670
Yakumo.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.090
Princess!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.760
I've been searching for you all this time.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.090
You were?

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.100
Thank goodness you're safe, Princess.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.970
Princess?

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:12.640
Kuro-sama is the princess of our clan.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.810
Kuro-chan, you're a princess?!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:15.650
Yeah.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.480
Yakumo, she's the one you were looking for?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.690
Yeah. She is my contractee.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.990
I'm Kogure Riona.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:26.620
Yakumo, I've made a contract, too,

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.030
with Keita-san here.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.660
I can't sense any Tera.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:35.870
Are you a Sub?

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.460
I'm a Master Root.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.250
Sort of.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.880
A Master Root?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:47.390
Riona-san escaped from the Kaionji Group after they made her a Master Root.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.390
Escaped?

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.810
Kaionji Group... Isn't that the huge enterprise that manages the K-ON Mart convenient store chain,

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.060
and is involved in the food service industry and even hotels?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:00.400
They're producing Master Roots behind the scenes, though.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.730
Master Roots?

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:07.320
The Kaionji Group then exerts control over those who've become Master Roots.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:08.660
And then?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:12.830
They prepare lodging, and you're able to get anything you want.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.710
That life was pretty comfortable.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:20.170
It seems I was going to be used in some experiment, which is why I escaped.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.090
An experiment?

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:25.590
It seems that Hiyou is the one behind that experiment.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:26.340
Hiyou?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.680
I encountered Yakumo after that.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.390
Stop!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.520
Stop it!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.940
Let me go!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.120
Even though he looks like this, he's actually quite strong.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.420
Yakumo was my brother's best disciple.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.380
I'm probably lucky because I'm a Master Root.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.090
I requested a contract with him after that.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.260
You requested one?

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.380
I want to have the strength to protect myself.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.970
I heard that I could become stronger after becoming a contractee.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:19.140
What is the Kaionji Group trying to do by producing Master Roots?

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:24.150
I heard rumors that one of the higher-ups is bringing the Master Roots to Okinawa.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.650
Okinawa?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:30.610
That someone is probably Reishin-sama.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.030
Who's Reishin?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:38.250
Hey, you're the one who got me involved! Don't clam up now!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.170
Don't be so rude to the princess!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:44.630
The princess is the daughter of the Maiden of the Shishigami clan,

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.670
the most revered person among the Mototsumitama.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:52.680
Reishin is... my brother.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:56.970
Very well.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.190
I'll tell you everything, Keita-san.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:13.700
Thanks for helping us and the princess.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.990
Don't worry about it.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:19.330
Yakumo, there's sauce all over your mouth.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:22.460
I'll go and buy some adhesive bandages from the convenience store.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.710
Oh yeah... Don't go near any K-ON Marts.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.460
Kaionji's surveillance cameras are installed in them.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.470
I-Is that so?

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:41.480
Our clan lived in a different world from humans.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.440
We lived in a pure land that's protected by a barrier.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:46.980
A pure land?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:50.400
Yes. That's the world in which Mototsumitama live.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:56.830
We lived a calm life, maintaining humanity's balance of coexistence from there.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:02.500
However, something happened a few days before the ceremony to revere the Reiseki.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:11.380
Our pure land is protected by a huge Reiseki, and so a huge amount of Tera flows through it.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:16.220
In comparison, there is no place in the outside world where Tera flows out.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.850
Is that so?

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:21.180
It's because you haven't gone to the outside world yet.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:24.020
I'll be fine no matter where I am, as long as Brother is with me.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.520
Reishin, Kuro.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.110
Mother!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.690
It's time for the Dream Gazing Ceremony.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.630
O Maiden of the Shishigami Clan...

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.930
Mother, what did you dream?

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:00.430
No, it wasn't an inauspicious dream...

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.870
You have silky hair, just like the Maiden.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.330
You've grown up to be so pretty.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.580
Princess!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.080
Yakumo, what's wrong?

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:29.920
This is bad.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.590
The prince is killing members of the clan one after another.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.170
What?! Brother did that?!

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.900
Please escape quickly.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:54.990
What about my brother?

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.740
He took the Maiden...

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.030
to the Reiseki.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.660
Princess?

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.990
Wait!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.000
Princess!

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.320
The prince is...

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.610
That's a lie.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.900
Brother wouldn't do that!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:45.790
It has yet to shatter?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.330
Brother!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:57.550
Mother...

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.260
Mother!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.010
Brother, did you really do this?

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:02.970
Yes.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:11.810
Why?

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.560
Why did you kill Mother?!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:19.150
I'm going to descend to the lower realm and create a new world.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:21.700
You killed all the members of the clan and Mother for that purpose?!

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.200
Those who stand against me will be destroyed.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.330
And I shall destroy the fate which binds the world.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.830
Brother...

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:35.460
You may rot here along with this pure land.

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.180
Mother...

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:56.400
No!

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:04.450
To kill my brother.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:10.500
Why did your brother even kill your mother?

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:18.210
Why he did that, though he treasured the pure land and members of our clan more than anything...

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.840
After I get that answer from him, I'll decide whether or not to kill him.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:26.140
That's why I'm going to Okinawa and...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.220
Kuro-sama, we finally meet.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:38.820
Hiyou...

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.440
Hiyou?

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:48.580
He was exiled because he kidnapped humans and took them into the pure land to perform repeated contract-related experiments.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.740
Experiments?

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.620
Thanks to those experiments,

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:59.290
I was able to grant the power of the Mototsumitama to humans and mass produce Tribal Ends.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:04.590
Reishin-sama recognized the fruits of my efforts...

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:08.430
The same Reishin-sama who came to the human world after killing the Maiden.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.720
Where's my brother?

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:12.220
I'll tell you everything,

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.600
as long as you become mine.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.770
Stop this!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.980
Well then, before that, I have to execute you.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:25.150
It's a grave sin for someone like you to form a contact with Kuro-sama.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:25.900
What?!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:26.740
Hiyou!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.240
Kuro!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:33.580
That guy's heart is right here, isn't it?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.290
Let me go!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.500
Stop it!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:40.040
Hiyou!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:44.010
Kuro-sama, are you planning to protect this ape?

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.630
Keita-san is my important contractee.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:50.300
You formed a contract with a man like him, who has such low Tera?

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:51.970
What is going on?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.470
Kuro-sama?!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.770
Kuro!

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.230
Try to synchro, then, if you're a contractee.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.020
What?!

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:05.400
Show me your Tera!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:14.160
So, a Sub is frightened of synchronizing?

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.160
Hiyou!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.130
Kuro-sama, I'll awaken you from your dreams!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:23.210
I'll do it gently.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.180
Kuro, let's synchro!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.010
Is that okay?

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.560
We've no choice but to fight.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.770
Synchro!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.650
Come, Kuro-sama!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.780
Shower me with all of your Tera!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.280
Go, Kuro!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.620
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.500
You did it!

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:09.380
There's no way you could defeat me with that level of synchro.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.010
My Exceed was ineffective?

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:18.180
Keita-kun and Kuro aren't here yet?

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.350
"Why don't you give up on going to Okinawa?"

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:24.190
"I can't do that."

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.190
Keita-san!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.200
You can just tell me to stop.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.700
As long as you beg, that is.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:43.580
Kuro!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:53.050
Have a taste of my power.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.550
Hiyou!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.970
So, that abnormal flow of Tera was from you?

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.100
Yakumo?

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:06.150
I've been searching for you, but you've decided to deliver yourself to me?

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:08.780
Riona-san!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.530
I know.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.750
Synchro!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.050
Yakumo!

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:54.700
Kuro-sama, I'll introduce you to my contractee soon.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.740
Very soon.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:16:59.580
Yakumo!

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.080
What happened?

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.130
We encountered some trouble,

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:12.090
but I'm okay since Yakumo came to my rescue.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:14.840
Hiyou-sama.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.840
We have discovered Kogure Riona and her Mototsumitama.

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.470
They are most likely—

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.220
Shut up!

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:24.850
Hiyou-sama...

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.100
What—

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.870
I have no choice but to get Shinobu involved.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.080
Punipuni, I'm sorry.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.870
Please bear with this for now.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.550
She lost her mother, too.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.510
Please don't look at me like that.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.510
I'm okay.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.770
You're always like that.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:06.600
Oh?

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.020
You should cry when you feel hurt.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.360
I cried a lot when my mother died.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.110
Keita-san, you did?

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.030
Yeah.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:22.530
That's why you shouldn't hold your tears back.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.420
Kuro?

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:44.350
Hey!

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.060
I didn't tell you cry here, did I?

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.360
I've made up my mind, too.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:06.450
Even if I'm a Sub, as long as we're contracted, I'll fight with you

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:11.080
until I pay back the debt I have to you for saving my life.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.670
Keita-san...

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:24.180
This is the first frame of the ED

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:42.410
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:42.410
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:53.830
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:53.830
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:19:54.130 --> 00:20:06.220
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:19:54.130 --> 00:20:06.220
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:22.610
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:22.610
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.530
Princess, I'll go too.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:28.620
I hate hot places.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.240
I'll go alone, then.

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:32.660
What? You intend to leave your contractee behind?!

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:35.120
T-That isn't my intention.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.500
Yakumo, we'll be okay.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.790
But...

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.800
Excel! Steiner!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.260
They are from The Noble One.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:45.430
Noble One?

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.510
Are you here to send us off?

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.470
Yes. I have something for him.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:54.940
Take this. It's the battle equipment, Thousand.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:55.940
Thousand?

00:20:56.150 --> 00:21:00.730
It's a tool that uses the contractee as a catalyst to produce special effects.

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:05.740
The power of Thousand will only react to the pure Tera of the contractee.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:09.580
Be sure to make it your own, and practice with it every day.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.120
Why are you giving it to me?

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.540
It's a charm.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.210
Show me your face.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:19.960
It seems that you've become somewhat good-looking.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.970
Princess, avert your eyes!

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.560
How filthy!

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.470
Don't forget this:

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:39.730
When a true crisis befalls a Mototsumitama, the contractee is the only one who can save her.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:41.730
"The Hiba Clan"
